{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SCORE is\u00a0an all-new kind of collaborative story game that lets you create the world\u2019s greatest heist movie with just 18 cards in under 18 minutes of game time. It\u2019s a revolutionary take on shared storytelling that needs no GM, no complex rules, no hefty rulebooks and gives you all the idea prompts you need to be the mastermind. We launched the card game it with crowdfunding in 2023 and in 2024 took it around the world. Now it's time to hack the system and go digital.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/extras/scoregif?t=1761266579\" /></span><strong>  </strong><br><br>Now you don't even need the cards - this app draws them for you. It also remembers the Talents of your crewmates and will prompt the right person to speak up (and kick ass). A tutorial is provided but don't worry: the game is crazy simple.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you'll pick a location you're breaking into and a thing you're trying to steal. Pick anything that sounds cool! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/extras/e274f67b475632430719e238fd2107c4.avif?t=1761266579\" width=540 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the app will tell each player what amazing skills they have brought to the heist. You can introduce yourself or skip ahead to the action!\u00a0The heist is broken up into 5 Acts, and when your Talents get drawn will determine if they work as planned or if things go off the rails. All you have to do is fill us in on the details! Heisting has never been so easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/extras/65bbdddb2b02d358fee6b95ec5389beb.avif?t=1761266579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/extras_big/65bbdddb2b02d358fee6b95ec5389beb.avif?t=1761266579 width=800 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506530?t=1761266579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761266579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/0bee56f8060200ec1d618e11393b37b8888e468d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761266579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/0bee56f8060200ec1d618e11393b37b8888e468d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761266579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SCORE is\u00a0an all-new kind of collaborative story game that lets you create the world\u2019s greatest heist movie with just 18 cards in under 18 minutes of game time. It\u2019s a revolutionary take on shared storytelling that needs no GM, no complex rules, no hefty rulebooks and gives you all the idea prompts you need to be the mastermind. We launched the card game it with crowdfunding in 2023 and in 2024 took it around the world. Now it's time to hack the system and go digital.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/extras/scoregif?t=1761266579\" /></span><strong>  </strong><br><br>Now you don't even need the cards - this app draws them for you. It also remembers the Talents of your crewmates and will prompt the right person to speak up (and kick ass). A tutorial is provided but don't worry: the game is crazy simple.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you'll pick a location you're breaking into and a thing you're trying to steal. Pick anything that sounds cool! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/extras/e274f67b475632430719e238fd2107c4.avif?t=1761266579\" width=540 height=960 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the app will tell each player what amazing skills they have brought to the heist. You can introduce yourself or skip ahead to the action!\u00a0The heist is broken up into 5 Acts, and when your Talents get drawn will determine if they work as planned or if things go off the rails. All you have to do is fill us in on the details! Heisting has never been so easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/extras/65bbdddb2b02d358fee6b95ec5389beb.avif?t=1761266579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/extras_big/65bbdddb2b02d358fee6b95ec5389beb.avif?t=1761266579 width=800 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Steve Dee","Dylan O'Dwyer"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506530/header.jpg?t=1761266579","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3506530/186